{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_iana_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_iana_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"探求明天","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_iana_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"3bdd64710127844cc3e9407b6cb51ec5309cdd9cf24de1cecc1d67014540d0c5","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"narration","text":"一次碰撞過後，檯面上的最後一顆球也進了洞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"俐落的桿法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"我是不是只打了開球的那一桿？從那之後就一直是你的個人表演賽，真棒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這不是我的本意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，BLITZ，我勸過你不要跟他玩這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"FUZE在敘拉古閒晃了一段時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是“瑪特廖什卡”把那個偽裝成桌球廳的家族交易點炸翻了，不知道他還要在那裡待多久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"那裡有什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有新情報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"只有新情報？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……還有特別帶勁的獸耳派對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"那你還炸了它？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，捲入家族火拼也不是我的本意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"裡屋傳來TACHANKA的大笑聲。\nBLITZ聳了聳肩，把落袋的球都丟到檯面上。FUZE拿起三角框，將四散的球都聚攏起來。\n經歷那一次“碰撞”之後，他們就這樣散落在這片名為“泰拉”的陌生大地上，追尋著各自想要尋求的答案。\n他們約定定期在這個落腳點會合，交流有趣的見聞並彙總情報，尋找返回地球的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"……對了，IANA呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"她今天又沒來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和上次一樣，誰都不知道她去哪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，今天大概還是不會露面吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"BLITZ絲毫不意外，向裡屋喊道——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，TACHANKA，聽到了吧，我說什麼來著？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"兄弟，她只是缺席了我們的碰頭會，這沒什麼大不了的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要是沒趕上我們返回地球的“太空飛船”，那才真是麻煩大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"說不定……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"不，她一定是我們之中，最想留在這片到處都是未知的大地的人了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看到光了，我們離外面不算遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"外面有什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡太窄了，我行動受限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可以再伸過去一點嗎？對，穿過那個縫隙，然後往右邊偏一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等，可能出了點小問題……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這樣足夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我能看清楚了，我們到了一個好地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是一個山洞口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"洞口外面是一片森林，長著些生於溫帶的落葉喬木。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"白雲，羽獸，還有一條水流緩慢的河……天氣很好，陽光很耀眼，沒有什麼危險訊號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是我們要去的地方嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，應該不是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"糟糕……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"邁耶小姐，可以請你的分身幫我調整一下機械手臂的伸展方向嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只要讓它恢復伸直的狀態就好……活動關節好像失靈了，我沒有辦法收回它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……分身只是投影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕它沒辦法幫到你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那可麻煩大了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們似乎卡在這裡了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——！你在幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"必須要把機械手臂從岩縫裡拔出來，展示“水坑倒立轉體三週半”的時候還得用到它……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"先按下這個，然後是這個，再把這個拉到底……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"引擎溫度突破警戒線了，停下來，別再——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，邁耶小姐……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是它自己停不下來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"爆炸的聲波轟響著衝向林間，驚起幾隻羽獸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發明家先生，情況如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳……勉強還可以，這種程度的爆炸在我們那都算不上什麼大事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過動力模組和能源模組都出了點小問題，我得看看怎麼讓它再動起來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他地方我都看過了，除了機械臂折斷了以外，基本沒有損壞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像你這樣能幫上我忙的地上人可不多見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還好，舉手之勞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你的學生……她好像有點不高興。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛帶回來了一籃子野果，又一聲不吭地跑走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，估計是在氣我把事情搞砸了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"設計這輛鑽地車的時候，我可沒想過去隔壁城邦評個發明家獎還要走這麼遠的路！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為它裝配了導航……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"導航？我們可不需要那種東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到那邊通往地底的河了嗎？只要順著它一直走，我們就能到達那座杜林城邦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地圖都在我們的腦子裡，就是不知道是哪個城邦的杜林人把這地底通道改得彎彎繞繞的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許我們可以直接走過去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪有去參加評選會，不帶上自己的發明的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說，這輛拋錨的鑽地車，就是你原本要帶去評獎的新發明？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我以為是那台“速成釀酒機”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那東西可沒什麼新奇的。杜林城邦裡到處都是那種東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是以這輛車現在的樣子，連預選都過不了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你擔心它太破了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用擔心，適當的缺憾也能展現一個新發明的特別之處嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈。要知道，特別的總能獲得高票數。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，更嚴重的問題是，如果要帶上它，我們可能連參賽都趕不上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，你看上去比我要心急許多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那座杜林城邦就在那裡，到那是或遲或早的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許還有別的辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以先走過去，只要沿著這條河……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，沿著這條河，經過四個地下山洞，在見到第八個巨型蘑菇之後，順著上面的岩壁爬上去，然後再……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總而言之，要是沒有杜林人帶路，你肯定會繞更大的彎子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更重要的是──如果沒帶上能夠讓杜林人振臂高呼的新發明，他們可能都不會讓你進去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耐心點吧，等我把它修好，它一定會帶你去你想去的地方！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想去的地方……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但願如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，這裡就都交給我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你去幫我看看那孩子？要是能再帶點吃的回來，就更好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們可以走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的老師說，他要把鑽地車修好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，真急人！老師總是這麼靠不住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我早就跟他說過，那個破鐵殼肯定評不上獎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"居然要開著它去表演“水坑倒立轉體三周半”……俗到爆炸欸！想想就丟臉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邁耶小姐，這些是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一些測繪儀器，一些戶外生存裝備，一些太陽能電池板。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在各地旅行，要藉助它們去瞭解我踏足的土地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，就是去外面玩的時候要帶上的東西嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好玩的，的確很重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“城邦最佳發明獎”的評選會上有很多好玩的，我期待了很久！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過……早知道是現在這樣，我就不跟著一起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……既然已經是現在這樣了，就只能等等了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們去那片森林裡看看吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_falls_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"河水潺潺流淌，IANA伏在岸邊的岩石上，緊盯著水面。\n忽然，水面漾起一陣波紋，她立刻按下操控板上的按鈕──\n設置在河床上的彈網瞬間彈出，把游過的鱗獸彈出水面，落進IANA腳邊的桶裡，一氣呵成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢噢！抓到了！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太厲害了吧！它是怎麼做到的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只需要一個遙控裝置，一組訊號收發器，一個有彈性的繩網，不過都是些鑽地車的備用零部件……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後將它們“連接”在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了，這是邁耶小姐的新發明！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比鑽地車有意思！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發明？應該不算……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她屏住呼吸，再次注視著河水。\n搖曳的樹，消散的雲，折射的日光，讓水面斑駁。\n忽然，IANA的瞳仁逐漸顯現出金黃色的光斑。\n透過另一個角度的視野，閃爍的波浪不再干擾她。\n水面上剛顯現出微小的擾動，彈網便再次彈出。\n從水中躍出一條更大、更有活力的鱗獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢噢噢！又抓到了一條！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以，差不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們獲得了充足的飲用水，幾條鱗獸，一些野果，再加上之前剩下的食物儲備，大概夠我們這幾天……就算再多幾天也足夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邁耶小姐，我可以試試嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿好操控板，抓著這裡，然後按這個遙控按鈕……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我不要這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個還是你拿著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我玩水，需要它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玩水？什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是，我從那邊游過來，等你看到我，就快快按下按鈕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之後繩網就會把我從水裡面彈起來，嘩啦啦——就像那幾條鱗獸一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我想這個捕魚……捕鱗裝置並不能這麼用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可它明明是我見過的最好玩的水上遊樂設施！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們留在這裡吧，我想多玩玩這個！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"留在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，那我們不去杜林城邦了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不去了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可……你不是很想去參加“評選會”嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是很想去啊，那樣我就能在水上樂園裡玩水了，評選會上會有很多新發明的水上遊樂設施！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過現在已經無所謂啦，在這裡我也能玩水！還有最好玩的“水上彈網”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邁耶小姐，我們再試試你的新發明吧？我想到了一些新的玩法！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得“地上森林河彈網捉迷藏”怎麼樣？來吧來吧，閉上眼睛，數到一百！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，野果鱗獸肉串！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……你在看《杜林工程》。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很有趣的期刊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不僅有十幾頁杜林工程研究論文，還有幾百頁奇妙的杜林發明小故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小傢伙，這裡寫的是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，這部分寫著，“在底部敲八下，再將輸入旋鈕旋至……”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以了，其他內容我多少都理解了，只差這個詞。確定是“敲八下”對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對！絕對沒錯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要知道這些做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是想學習一下這些模組的構成與功能……或許之後也能幫上忙吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了，你一定是想要改進“水上彈網”，或者是發明一種新的水上遊樂設施。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我只是想快點把那輛鑽地車修好……這樣就能早點去那座地底城邦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邁耶小姐為什麼想去那座杜林城邦呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……可能是為了一個還未確定的結果吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有親眼見證所有可能，我才會為那個猜想畫上句點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你會和我們一起玩水嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？……可能不會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可……如果不玩水，去那座杜林城邦還有什麼意義呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"有什麼意義呢？\n在尋找的旅途中，猜想一次又一次被證偽。\n她漸漸意識到，自己就像在舊房間裡翻找一件遺失的重要物品。\n找遍書櫥，搜遍抽屜，最後僅剩藏在床底的一個圓鐵盒還沒有被揭開——\n她或許已經猜到答案，但她還是要找到盒子，將它打開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，這都是有意義的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance"},{"type":"narration","text":"第二天"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說，鑽地車還沒修好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不，這麼說並不準確。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"準確的說法是，鑽地車修不好了……嗝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好大的酒味！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……速成釀酒機裡，都是我昨天摘的果子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，果酒真好喝……這片森林是好地方，我要留在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨晚修車修到大半夜，動力模組實在是修不好了，還好有這些果酒……嗝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要幫它取個名字，就叫“鑽地車2號”佳釀怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得棒極了，正好用來紀念死去的“鑽地車1號”……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……老師？老師！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果酒……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"望著從鑽地車中升起的黑煙，IANA嘆了一口氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼辦，照現在的狀況，我們是不是去不了那座杜林城邦了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也蠻好的啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣我們就可以留在這裡繼續玩“地上森林河彈網捉迷藏”了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不，我們不玩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們要去那座杜林城邦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邁耶小姐？可是老師他……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發明獎的評選會還有幾天？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三天！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三天的話……有點緊張，可能趕不上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趕不上的話，下週還有！下週趕不上的話，下下週還有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“城邦最佳發明獎”的評選會，每週都會舉辦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，那我們就趕下下週的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小傢伙，想不想試試看更有意思的水上遊樂設施？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在有一個更棒的想法。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔，這裡是哪？我好像睡了很久……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我記得我喝了很好喝的果酒……對了，我的鑽地車，我還得修我的鑽地車！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不對，我好像就在鑽地車裡面……裡面好像變得更寬敞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且……它好像在移動？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真的假的……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"邁耶小姐——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梅——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"杜林人發明家打開艙門，卻被眼前的一幕驚得說不出話來。\n“城邦最佳發明獎”候選，那輛最讓他驕傲的鑽地車，此時竟然正航行在一條地下的河流上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老師！您終於醒了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎來到“鑽地車3號”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"準確地說，該叫它“鑽地船”了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來我的酒還沒有醒，我還要昏睡多久……不，這不是醉酒的感覺，可我還是有點暈……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……所以到底是怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和你的學生對它進行了一點小小的改裝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多虧了她，我才能實現我的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個堅硬的鑽頭現在已經變成舵葉啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還裝上了增大升級版的“水上彈網”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些損壞的部件只能丟掉了，很抱歉。不過這也幫助“鑽地船”減輕了不少重量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丟掉了？你是說那些源石動力模組……可是沒有動力的話，怎麼動得起來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們在順著水流向地底行駛，河水會提供一些動力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果動力不足，我們還有這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"機械手臂？……不，現在它更像是船槳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，沒想到我們現在要划船去評獎了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確實……很特別！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們說，我們要不要從穹頂水道直衝到頒獎台上呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感覺是個不錯的故事素材……我得趕緊記下來，之後投稿到《杜林工程》上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你們有沒有覺得它越來越快了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是越來越快了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，我們好像要進入地底暗河了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暗河？那——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小傢伙，開啟密封艙蓋吧，我們要潛水了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老成的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……潛水？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"潛水！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"準備好，抓穩了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"情緒激動的杜林人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"噢噢噢噢——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們還有什麼我不知道的秘密呢？我會親眼去那裡看一看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再一次讓我期待，再一次讓我驚訝吧——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，讓我們猜一下，每晚都興奮得睡不著覺的IANA，現在正在哪裡探險呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"在汐斯塔泡火山溫泉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在謝拉格登山。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許去了雷姆必拓，也許去了米諾斯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總而言之……和我們一樣，IANA也對這片大地充滿好奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是IANA的好奇心比我們更旺盛吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"要是她更好奇如何回到地球這件事就好了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，BLITZ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是真有返回地球的辦法，那也一定是我先找到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"IANA？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"你居然來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼還帶來這麼一大堆東西……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼……“速成釀酒機”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，看上去有點意思，讓我來試試！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些文件……是泰拉各地的地質資料和環境調查資料？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥倫比亞、薩爾貢、維多利亞……每個地區都有，很詳盡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些地點被重點標註了，似乎都與磁山二號實驗室的那處山洞極為相似。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得在這些地點之中，會有“傳送”回地球的“通道”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"IANA抽出壓在最下方的一張紙，放在這疊厚厚的資料上面。\n這是她對那座杜林地下城邦的考察報告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這份報告的結論是……排除？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是說排除了這個地點作為“通道”的可能性吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是排除全部疑似地點的可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每一處我都親自考察過了，那座杜林城邦便是我的最後一站。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的結論是，它們全部與磁山二號的山洞無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若想找到返回地球的方法，我們只有換一條路了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是料想得到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，那就繼續找別的路。我可是更有幹勁了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們可以討論一下源石的方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這片存在著礦石病的大地，或許源石的本質之中就蘊藏著相關的秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，的確還有很多可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就讓我們繼續探求下去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，只是……我還以為你會是我們這裡最不想回地球的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不會接受這種形式的天降好運。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然已經不明不白地來到這裡了……那我一定要找到返回地球的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，我也會去享受遇見的風景，這並不衝突。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"IANA搖了搖手中的資料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"這是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"“城邦最佳發明獎”……怎麼還有個獎狀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，這是熱情的杜林人送給我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"所以說，你去地底城邦考察，還順便拿了個發明獎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"這張得獎照片，我的天——你們一定要看一看！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g20_skyblue_R1"},{"type":"narration","text":"蔚藍的穹頂之下，一架外觀奇異的載具從地底瀑布上躍出。\n彩虹從飛濺的水幕中築起，圍觀的杜林人都在振臂歡呼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_457_blitz","aliases":["BLITZ"]},{"speakerId":"char_459_tachak","aliases":["TACHANKA"]}]}
